# Atlas Core - Dashboard Density Refactoring Specification
**Author:** Volt Fontaine  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D19 23:35  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Refactoring specification and updated layout token schema to reduce visual density and cognitive overhead on Atlas Core dashboards, aligned with the Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.itskokos.internal/schemas/v2/tokens.json",
  "meta": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Volt Fontaine (Design)",
